{
  "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
  "juan": "Juan5",
  "section": "卷五",
  "entries": [
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P000_S000",
      "original_quote": "《卷五》",
      "paragraph_index": 0,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P001_S000",
      "original_quote": "傷門剋應",
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P002_S000",
      "original_quote": "傷門不可說，夫妻主災迍，瘡病行不得，折損血財牲，天穴人枉死，經年有病人，商音信難得，餘事不堪陳。",
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P003_S000",
      "original_quote": "問曰：傷門屬木，正值春分之時，嫩甲發生，當以吉看，反以凶論，請問其詳？",
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P004_S000",
      "original_quote": "衢仙答曰：「傷門之木，正值春分之氣，精液自內而發揚於外，以致根本洩之太過，所謂以外華而內虛，而不能勝其勞。",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P004_S001",
      "original_quote": "況二月中嫩甲不能當霜露之寒，因謂之傷，所 以凶也。",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P004_S002",
      "original_quote": "傷門得奇，惟宜捕捉逃亡盜賊、漁獵、索債、賭戲等事則吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P004_S003",
      "original_quote": "若上官、出行、嫁娶、商賈、修造、埋葬皆不利，大凶」。",
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P005_S000",
      "original_quote": "靜應",
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P006_S000",
      "original_quote": "傷門加傷：主變動，遠行皆折傷，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P007_S000",
      "original_quote": "加杜：主變動、失脫、官司、桎梏，百事凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P008_S000",
      "original_quote": "加景：主文書、印信、口舌、動撓、啾喞。",
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P009_S000",
      "original_quote": "加死：主官司、印信，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P009_S001",
      "original_quote": "出行，大忌。",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P009_S002",
      "original_quote": "占病，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 9,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P010_S000",
      "original_quote": "加驚：主親人疾病憂懼，謀伐不利，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 10,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P011_S000",
      "original_quote": "加開：主貴人，開張有走失變動之事，不利。",
      "paragraph_index": 11,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P012_S000",
      "original_quote": "加休：主陽人變動，或托人謀幹財名不利。",
      "paragraph_index": 12,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P013_S000",
      "original_quote": "加生：原文缺",
      "paragraph_index": 13,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P014_S000",
      "original_quote": "加甲戊：主失脫難獲。",
      "paragraph_index": 14,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P015_S000",
      "original_quote": "加乙：主求謀不得，反防盜失財。",
      "paragraph_index": 15,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P016_S000",
      "original_quote": "加丙：主道路損失。",
      "paragraph_index": 16,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P017_S000",
      "original_quote": "加丁：主音信不的。",
      "paragraph_index": 17,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P018_S000",
      "original_quote": "加己：主財散人病。",
      "paragraph_index": 18,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P019_S000",
      "original_quote": "加庚：主訟獄被刑杖，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 19,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P020_S000",
      "original_quote": "加辛：主夫妻懷私、恣怨。",
      "paragraph_index": 20,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P021_S000",
      "original_quote": "加壬：主因盜牽連。",
      "paragraph_index": 21,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P022_S000",
      "original_quote": "加癸：主訟獄被冤，有理難伸。",
      "paragraph_index": 22,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P023_S000",
      "original_quote": "動應",
      "paragraph_index": 23,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P024_S000",
      "original_quote": "傷門出者，三十里見人爭鬪，見漁人或畜爭鬪，敵宜避之，大吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 24,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P025_S000",
      "original_quote": "傷門加傷：三里、十三里逢二車塞道爭行。",
      "paragraph_index": 25,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P026_S000",
      "original_quote": "加杜：四里、十四里逢公吏人及木匠伐樹，並有婦人抱小兒過。",
      "paragraph_index": 26,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P027_S000",
      "original_quote": "加景：九里、十九里逢色衣人騎騾馬過。",
      "paragraph_index": 27,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P028_S000",
      "original_quote": "加死：二里、十二里逢埋葬及孝服人哭泣。",
      "paragraph_index": 28,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P029_S000",
      "original_quote": "加驚：七里、十七里逢人鬪打並趕畜，有婦人與少女同行。",
      "paragraph_index": 29,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P030_S000",
      "original_quote": "加開：六里、十六里逢人拆牆、安門、解板，或二豬相咬。",
      "paragraph_index": 30,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P031_S000",
      "original_quote": "加休：一里、十一里逢老婦與少男同行。",
      "paragraph_index": 31,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P032_S000",
      "original_quote": "加生：八里、十八里逢人伐樹或培土。",
      "paragraph_index": 32,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P033_S000",
      "original_quote": "占身命：水火木命者吉，金命者主病，土命者凶，官司、刑杖。",
      "paragraph_index": 33,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P034_S000",
      "original_quote": "杜門剋應",
      "paragraph_index": 34,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P035_S000",
      "original_quote": "杜門原是木，犯者災禍頻，亥卯未年月，遭入獄迍生，生死離別事，六畜也多瘟，跌打見膿血，禍害及子孫。",
      "paragraph_index": 35,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P036_S000",
      "original_quote": "問曰：杜門陽木，夏冬繁盛之時，本為旺氣，何以凶論？",
      "paragraph_index": 36,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P037_S000",
      "original_quote": "衢仙答曰：杜門陽木，時值夏冬，發生於外，而津液已洩，陽氣亢極，一陰將至，木性至此而力屈，欲收斂而不能收斂，欲生旺而力已盡，又不洩其力以實其子，而待陰伏藏其子於堅密之處，恐有傷於子，故謂之杜門，小凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 37,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P038_S000",
      "original_quote": "杜門為藏形之方，為宜躲災避難，塞穴、捕捉則吉，餘事皆不利。",
      "paragraph_index": 38,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P039_S000",
      "original_quote": "靜應",
      "paragraph_index": 39,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P040_S000",
      "original_quote": "杜門加杜：主因父母疾病、田宅出脫事，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 40,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P041_S000",
      "original_quote": "加景：主文書印信阻隔，陽人、小口疾病，遲疑不利。",
      "paragraph_index": 41,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P042_S000",
      "original_quote": "加死：主田宅；",
      "paragraph_index": 42,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P042_S001",
      "original_quote": "文書失落，官司破財，小凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 42,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P043_S000",
      "original_quote": "加驚：主門戶內憂疑驚恐，並有詞訟事。",
      "paragraph_index": 43,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P044_S000",
      "original_quote": "加開：主見貴人、官長，謀事主先破己財後吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 44,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P045_S000",
      "original_quote": "加休：主求財有益。",
      "paragraph_index": 45,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P046_S000",
      "original_quote": "加生：主陽人小口破財，及田宅求財不成。",
      "paragraph_index": 46,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P047_S000",
      "original_quote": "加傷：主兄弟相爭，田產破財。",
      "paragraph_index": 47,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P048_S000",
      "original_quote": "加甲戊：主謀事不成，密處求財得。",
      "paragraph_index": 48,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P049_S000",
      "original_quote": "加乙：主宜暗求陽人財物，後主不明至訟。",
      "paragraph_index": 49,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P050_S000",
      "original_quote": "加丙：主文契遺失。",
      "paragraph_index": 50,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P051_S000",
      "original_quote": "加丁：主陽人訟獄。",
      "paragraph_index": 51,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P052_S000",
      "original_quote": "加己：主私謀害人招非。",
      "paragraph_index": 52,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P053_S000",
      "original_quote": "加庚：主因女人訟獄被刑。",
      "paragraph_index": 53,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P054_S000",
      "original_quote": "加辛：主打傷人詞訟，陽人、小口凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 54,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P055_S000",
      "original_quote": "加壬：主奸盜事，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 55,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P056_S000",
      "original_quote": "加癸：主百事皆阻，病者不食。",
      "paragraph_index": 56,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P057_S000",
      "original_quote": "動應",
      "paragraph_index": 57,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P058_S000",
      "original_quote": "杜門出三十里逢少女同行歌唱，六十里逢惡人。",
      "paragraph_index": 58,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P058_S001",
      "original_quote": "乙奇臨，見少婦著色衣；",
      "paragraph_index": 58,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P058_S002",
      "original_quote": "丙奇臨，見火光燒屋或烽火之物；",
      "paragraph_index": 58,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P058_S003",
      "original_quote": "丁奇臨，見人騎馬帶弓弩。",
      "paragraph_index": 58,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P059_S000",
      "original_quote": "杜門加杜：四里、十四里逢婦人引孫兒著綠衣。",
      "paragraph_index": 59,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P060_S000",
      "original_quote": "加景：九里、十九里逢孕婦著色衣，或公吏人騎赤馬。",
      "paragraph_index": 60,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P061_S000",
      "original_quote": "加死：二里、十二里逢喪服人哭泣。",
      "paragraph_index": 61,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P062_S000",
      "original_quote": "加驚：七里、十七里逢歌唱鑼鼓聲，或人言公訟事。",
      "paragraph_index": 62,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P063_S000",
      "original_quote": "加開：六里、十六里逢歌唱及犬咬豬。",
      "paragraph_index": 63,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P064_S000",
      "original_quote": "加休：一里、十一里逢唱戲或皂衣婦人抱孩兒。",
      "paragraph_index": 64,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P065_S000",
      "original_quote": "加生：八里、十八里逢人扛錢，或手拿食物並唱詞。",
      "paragraph_index": 65,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P066_S000",
      "original_quote": "加傷：三里、十三里逢木匠拿木棍。",
      "paragraph_index": 66,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P067_S000",
      "original_quote": "占身命：火命者發貴，水命者發富，木命者平穩，金命者疾病，土命者官司凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 67,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P067_S001",
      "original_quote": "若金年月日時，或土命年月日時者不利，如逢水火年月日時吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 67,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P068_S000",
      "original_quote": "景門剋應",
      "paragraph_index": 68,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P069_S000",
      "original_quote": "景門主血光，官符賣田莊，禍災應多有，子孫受苦殃，外凶並惡死，六畜也見傷，生離與死別，占者須堤防。",
      "paragraph_index": 69,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P070_S000",
      "original_quote": "問曰：景門屬火，南方夏令，正值陽明之域，何以為凶也？",
      "paragraph_index": 70,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P071_S000",
      "original_quote": "衢仙答曰：景門夏令之氣，萬物壯盛，將老之時，與死門坤宮相近，又為陽之盛氣，天數至此時，將有殺物之情，雖主上明下亮之方，亦不全吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 71,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P071_S001",
      "original_quote": "惟利文書之事，因為次吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 71,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P072_S000",
      "original_quote": "景門用事，惟宜上書、獻策、奏對、選拔將士，吉，餘者不利。",
      "paragraph_index": 72,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P072_S001",
      "original_quote": "坤、艮、中宮吉，三、四宮平之，一宮迫吟，六、七宮迫宮，大凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 72,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P072_S002",
      "original_quote": "若得三奇，又宜於設計行詐、破陣、火攻、號令、封功、賞爵等事。",
      "paragraph_index": 72,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P073_S000",
      "original_quote": "靜應",
      "paragraph_index": 73,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P074_S000",
      "original_quote": "景門加景：主文狀未動，有預先見之意，內有陽人小口憂患。",
      "paragraph_index": 74,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P075_S000",
      "original_quote": "加死：主官訟，因田宅事爭，多啾唧。",
      "paragraph_index": 75,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P076_S000",
      "original_quote": "加驚：主陽人、小口疾病事，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 76,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P077_S000",
      "original_quote": "加開：主官人升遷吉，求文印更吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 77,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P078_S000",
      "original_quote": "加休：主文書遺失，爭訟不休。",
      "paragraph_index": 78,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P079_S000",
      "original_quote": "加生：主陰人生產大喜，更主求財旺利，行人皆吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 79,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P080_S000",
      "original_quote": "加傷：主姻親眷小口角，或嫌隙撓亂。",
      "paragraph_index": 80,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P081_S000",
      "original_quote": "加杜：主失脫文書，散財後平。",
      "paragraph_index": 81,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P082_S000",
      "original_quote": "加甲戊：主因財產詞訟，遠行吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 82,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P083_S000",
      "original_quote": "加乙：主訟事不成。",
      "paragraph_index": 83,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P084_S000",
      "original_quote": "加丙：主文書急迫，火速不利。",
      "paragraph_index": 84,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P085_S000",
      "original_quote": "加丁：主因文書、印狀招非。",
      "paragraph_index": 85,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P086_S000",
      "original_quote": "加己：主官事牽連。",
      "paragraph_index": 86,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P087_S000",
      "original_quote": "加庚：主訟人自訟。",
      "paragraph_index": 87,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P088_S000",
      "original_quote": "加辛：主陰人詞訟。",
      "paragraph_index": 88,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P089_S000",
      "original_quote": "加壬：主因賊牽連。",
      "paragraph_index": 89,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P090_S000",
      "original_quote": "加癸：主因奴婢致禍。",
      "paragraph_index": 90,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P091_S000",
      "original_quote": "動應",
      "paragraph_index": 91,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P092_S000",
      "original_quote": "景門出三十里外，赤紋大蛇，七十里外，因水火失物。",
      "paragraph_index": 92,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P092_S001",
      "original_quote": "若強有作為，主東家長及小口。",
      "paragraph_index": 92,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P093_S000",
      "original_quote": "景門加景：九里、十九里逢人抱文書，更有火光驚恐。",
      "paragraph_index": 93,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P094_S000",
      "original_quote": "加死：二里、十二里逢喪服人哭泣，色衣人騎馬。",
      "paragraph_index": 94,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P095_S000",
      "original_quote": "加驚：七里、十七里逢爭訟鬥打，宜避之。",
      "paragraph_index": 95,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P096_S000",
      "original_quote": "加開：六里、十六里逢人成隊行，官人騎馬。",
      "paragraph_index": 96,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P097_S000",
      "original_quote": "加休：一里、十一里逢女人哭泣與賣魚人並行。",
      "paragraph_index": 97,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P098_S000",
      "original_quote": "加生：八里、十八里逢小兒趕牛，人背錢以袋裝之。",
      "paragraph_index": 98,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P099_S000",
      "original_quote": "加傷：三里、十三里逢色衣女人坐車轎或乘騾馬。",
      "paragraph_index": 99,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P100_S000",
      "original_quote": "加杜：四里、十四里逢老少婦領黑衣童子行。",
      "paragraph_index": 100,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P101_S000",
      "original_quote": "占身命：主火災。",
      "paragraph_index": 101,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P101_S001",
      "original_quote": "水命者大凶，金命者疾病，木命者中平，土命者富。",
      "paragraph_index": 101,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P101_S002",
      "original_quote": "若值金水年月日時者，不利。",
      "paragraph_index": 101,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P102_S000",
      "original_quote": "死門剋應",
      "paragraph_index": 102,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P103_S000",
      "original_quote": "元死之方最為凶，人命逢之禍不輕，犯者平平財產退，更防孝服死人丁。",
      "paragraph_index": 103,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P104_S000",
      "original_quote": "問曰：死門屬土，又系黑星，分夜之方，秋冬之氣，天地肅殺，自此而始彰，門凶星凶，當棄之而不用，不知此門寧可用之？",
      "paragraph_index": 104,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P105_S000",
      "original_quote": "衢仙答曰：死門之凶，天地令行，大肆肅殺之威，草柳色變，木逢葉落，故為凶象。",
      "paragraph_index": 105,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P105_S001",
      "original_quote": "若得奇相助，而吊死刑、捕捉、畋獵之事，有得吉者，順天之序而然也，不可棄。",
      "paragraph_index": 105,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P106_S000",
      "original_quote": "靜應",
      "paragraph_index": 106,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P107_S000",
      "original_quote": "死門加死：主官司而留，印信無氣，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 107,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P107_S001",
      "original_quote": "加死：主官司動而被刑杖，凶？",
      "paragraph_index": 107,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P108_S000",
      "original_quote": "加驚：主因官司不給，憂疑、患病，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 108,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P109_S000",
      "original_quote": "加開：主見貴人，求印信、文書事，大利。",
      "paragraph_index": 109,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P110_S000",
      "original_quote": "加休：主求財物事不吉，若問僧道求方吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 110,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P111_S000",
      "original_quote": "加生：主喪事，求財得。",
      "paragraph_index": 111,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P111_S001",
      "original_quote": "占病，死者複生。",
      "paragraph_index": 111,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P112_S000",
      "original_quote": "加傷：原文缺",
      "paragraph_index": 112,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P113_S000",
      "original_quote": "加杜：原文缺",
      "paragraph_index": 113,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P114_S000",
      "original_quote": "加景：主主因文契、印信、財產事見官，先怒後喜，不凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 114,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P115_S000",
      "original_quote": "加甲戊：主作偽財。",
      "paragraph_index": 115,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P116_S000",
      "original_quote": "加乙：主求事不成。",
      "paragraph_index": 116,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P117_S000",
      "original_quote": "加丙：主信息憂疑。",
      "paragraph_index": 117,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P118_S000",
      "original_quote": "加丁：主老陽人疾病。",
      "paragraph_index": 118,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P119_S000",
      "original_quote": "加己：主病訟牽連不已，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 119,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P120_S000",
      "original_quote": "加庚：主女人生產，子母俱凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 120,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P121_S000",
      "original_quote": "加辛：主盜賊，失脫難獲。",
      "paragraph_index": 121,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P122_S000",
      "original_quote": "加壬：主訟人自訟、自招。",
      "paragraph_index": 122,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P123_S000",
      "original_quote": "加癸：主嫁娶；",
      "paragraph_index": 123,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P123_S001",
      "original_quote": "婦女事凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 123,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P124_S000",
      "original_quote": "動應",
      "paragraph_index": 124,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P125_S000",
      "original_quote": "死門出者，二十里逢病人，三十里逢孝服、血光事，雖有三奇，亦不吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 125,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P125_S001",
      "original_quote": "丙奇臨，逢抱文書；",
      "paragraph_index": 125,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P125_S002",
      "original_quote": "乙奇臨，見喪葬祭物或紙扎物；",
      "paragraph_index": 125,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P125_S003",
      "original_quote": "丁奇臨，逢少婦孝服、哭泣。",
      "paragraph_index": 125,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P126_S000",
      "original_quote": "死門加死：二里、十二里逢婦人哭泣，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 126,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P127_S000",
      "original_quote": "加驚：七里、十七里逢喪哭泣，或死畜物類。",
      "paragraph_index": 127,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P128_S000",
      "original_quote": "加開：六里、十六里逢開墳、哭泣，或畜鬪傷。",
      "paragraph_index": 128,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P129_S000",
      "original_quote": "加休：一里、十一里逢青衣婦人哭泣。",
      "paragraph_index": 129,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P130_S000",
      "original_quote": "加生：八里、十八里逢孝子拿生物大慟。",
      "paragraph_index": 130,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P131_S000",
      "original_quote": "加傷：三里、十三里逢人抬棺槨。",
      "paragraph_index": 131,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P132_S000",
      "original_quote": "加杜：四里、十四里逢埋葬及紙扎彩色物。",
      "paragraph_index": 132,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P133_S000",
      "original_quote": "加景：九里、十九里逢重孝人哭泣，退吉進凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 133,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P134_S000",
      "original_quote": "占身命：主有孝服、病死之凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 134,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P134_S001",
      "original_quote": "水木命並年月日時者，大凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 134,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P134_S002",
      "original_quote": "餘平。",
      "paragraph_index": 134,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P135_S000",
      "original_quote": "驚門剋應",
      "paragraph_index": 135,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P136_S000",
      "original_quote": "驚門主爭訟，瘟疫死人丁，辰年並花月，非禍進門庭。",
      "paragraph_index": 136,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P136_S001",
      "original_quote": "惟宜詞訟事、捕捉、博戲吉，餘皆凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 136,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P137_S000",
      "original_quote": "問曰：驚門屬金，值八月秋令，萬物俱老，天地大示肅殺之威，亦可棄乎？",
      "paragraph_index": 137,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P138_S000",
      "original_quote": "衢仙答曰：驚門氣肅，物數蒼老，本無生氣，固凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 138,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P138_S001",
      "original_quote": "但天地存好生之心，不欲殺盡，而生蒜麥，亦不得已而殺也。",
      "paragraph_index": 138,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P138_S002",
      "original_quote": "此門雖凶，若諛詞、獻詐、捕捉、設疑、伏兵皆吉，亦不可棄。",
      "paragraph_index": 138,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P139_S000",
      "original_quote": "靜應",
      "paragraph_index": 139,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P140_S000",
      "original_quote": "驚門加驚：主疾病、憂慮、驚疑。",
      "paragraph_index": 140,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P141_S000",
      "original_quote": "加開：主憂疑、官司、驚恐，又主上見喜，不凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 141,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P142_S000",
      "original_quote": "加休：主求財事， 或因口舌、求財事，遲吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 142,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P143_S000",
      "original_quote": "加生：主因婦人生憂驚，或因求財生憂驚，皆吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 143,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P144_S000",
      "original_quote": "加傷：主因商議同謀害人事洩，惹訟，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 144,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P145_S000",
      "original_quote": "加杜：主因失脫破財、驚恐，不凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 145,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P146_S000",
      "original_quote": "加景：主詞訟不息及小口疾病。",
      "paragraph_index": 146,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P147_S000",
      "original_quote": "加死：主因宅中怪異而生是非，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 147,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P148_S000",
      "original_quote": "加甲戊：主損財、信阻。",
      "paragraph_index": 148,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P149_S000",
      "original_quote": "加乙：主謀財不得。",
      "paragraph_index": 149,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P150_S000",
      "original_quote": "加丙：主文書印信驚恐。",
      "paragraph_index": 150,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P151_S000",
      "original_quote": "加丁：主詞訟牽連。",
      "paragraph_index": 151,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P152_S000",
      "original_quote": "加戊：主因田宅致訟。",
      "paragraph_index": 152,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P153_S000",
      "original_quote": "加己：主惡犬傷人成訟。",
      "paragraph_index": 153,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P154_S000",
      "original_quote": "加庚：主道路損折、賊盜，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 154,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P155_S000",
      "original_quote": "加辛：主女人成訟，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 155,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P156_S000",
      "original_quote": "加壬：主官司囚禁。",
      "paragraph_index": 156,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P156_S001",
      "original_quote": "病者，大凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 156,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P157_S000",
      "original_quote": "加癸：主被盜賊，失物不獲。",
      "paragraph_index": 157,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P158_S000",
      "original_quote": "動應",
      "paragraph_index": 158,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P159_S000",
      "original_quote": "驚門出者，三十里逢群鳥雀噪，六畜相鬪，四十里見人爭打則吉，若無，七十里必有折損之凶，不可前往。",
      "paragraph_index": 159,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P160_S000",
      "original_quote": "驚門加驚：七里、十七里逢二女吵鬧，旁人說打官司。",
      "paragraph_index": 160,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P161_S000",
      "original_quote": "加開：六里、十六里逢官吏、役人爭訟。",
      "paragraph_index": 161,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P162_S000",
      "original_quote": "加休：一里、十一里逢青衣婦人說官司。",
      "paragraph_index": 162,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P163_S000",
      "original_quote": "加生：八里、十八里逢女人引童子趕牛，小兒拿吃物。",
      "paragraph_index": 163,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P164_S000",
      "original_quote": "加傷：三里、十三里逢男女吵鬧、打孩子，宜退回。",
      "paragraph_index": 164,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P165_S000",
      "original_quote": "若強行，主車折馬死，凶。",
      "paragraph_index": 165,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P166_S000",
      "original_quote": "加杜：四里、十四里逢僧道同行，或男女相商。",
      "paragraph_index": 166,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P167_S000",
      "original_quote": "加景：九里、十九里逢色衣婦人說官司。",
      "paragraph_index": 167,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P168_S000",
      "original_quote": "加死：二里、十二里逢女人哭泣及喪亡者。",
      "paragraph_index": 168,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P169_S000",
      "original_quote": "占身命：主詞訟、官災、口舌、血光之事。",
      "paragraph_index": 169,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P169_S001",
      "original_quote": "若值丙丁巳午年月日時，占者，凶；",
      "paragraph_index": 169,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P169_S002",
      "original_quote": "甲乙寅卯年月日時占者，亦不利。",
      "paragraph_index": 169,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P170_S000",
      "original_quote": "五假法",
      "paragraph_index": 170,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P171_S000",
      "original_quote": "天假：景門合乙丙丁三奇，下臨地盤九天宮者，名曰「天假」。",
      "paragraph_index": 171,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P171_S001",
      "original_quote": "乙為天德，丙為天威，丁為太陰，凡三奇之靈，宜陳事、利便、進謁、乾求之事，大吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 171,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P172_S000",
      "original_quote": "地假：杜門合丁己癸，下臨地盤九地宮者，名曰「地假」；",
      "paragraph_index": 172,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P172_S001",
      "original_quote": "宜潛藏、埋伏，此三時宜遁跡藏形。",
      "paragraph_index": 172,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P173_S000",
      "original_quote": "地假：傷門合丁己癸，下臨地盤太陰宮者，亦名「地假」；",
      "paragraph_index": 173,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P173_S001",
      "original_quote": "宜遣人、行間諜、謀探私事。",
      "paragraph_index": 173,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P173_S002",
      "original_quote": "又如六合宮，亦名「地假」，宜逃亡、躲災、避難。",
      "paragraph_index": 173,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P174_S000",
      "original_quote": "神假：傷門合丁己癸，下臨地盤九地宮者，名曰「神假」，利埋葬。",
      "paragraph_index": 174,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P174_S001",
      "original_quote": "伏藏，人不能知也。",
      "paragraph_index": 174,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P175_S000",
      "original_quote": "人假：驚門合六合一作六壬，下臨地盤九天宮者，名曰「人假」，利捕捉逃亡。",
      "paragraph_index": 175,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P175_S001",
      "original_quote": "若太白入熒惑在其下，必獲。",
      "paragraph_index": 175,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P176_S000",
      "original_quote": "鬼假：死門合丁己癸，下臨地盤九地宮者，名曰「鬼假」，利超亡、薦度。",
      "paragraph_index": 176,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P176_S001",
      "original_quote": "一作臨「三隱宮」，疑即地盤之三吉門也？",
      "paragraph_index": 176,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P176_S002",
      "original_quote": "三隱宮太陰、六合、九地。",
      "paragraph_index": 176,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P177_S000",
      "original_quote": "三詐法",
      "paragraph_index": 177,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P178_S000",
      "original_quote": "凡事宜開、休、生三吉門，即不得乙丙丁三奇亦吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 178,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P178_S001",
      "original_quote": "又取陰神相助，謂之三詐，有地盤九地、太陰、六合三神助奇，謂之「陽門得助」，再得地盤吉門相助者，全吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 178,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P179_S000",
      "original_quote": "若開、休、生三吉門合乙丙丁三奇，無地盤太陰、六合、九地者，謂之有門無遁，陽有奇無陰，凡事有七分之利。",
      "paragraph_index": 179,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P180_S000",
      "original_quote": "開休生三吉門合三奇，下臨地盤太陰之宮者，再得吉門，此吉門當作吉星相助，謂之「真詐」，利施恩、隱遁、祈禱、求仙，吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 180,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P181_S000",
      "original_quote": "開休生合三奇，下臨地盤六合宮者，再得吉門相助，謂之「休詐」，宜合藥、法符、祈神、禳災、祭祀，皆大吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 181,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P182_S000",
      "original_quote": "開休生合三奇，下臨地盤九地宮者，再得吉門相助，謂之「重詐」，宜收降、添兵、進人口、納財、襲爵、拜綬，皆吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 182,
      "tag": []
    },
    {
      "line_id": "QMDJ_Juan5_P183_S000",
      "original_quote": "以上詐門，凡事遠行、商賈、嫁娶，百事大吉。",
      "paragraph_index": 183,
      "tag": []
    }
  ],
  "_source": {
    "text": "奇門遁甲秘笈大全",
    "juan": "Juan5",
    "line_id_start": "QMDJ_Juan5_P000_S000",
    "line_id_end": "QMDJ_Juan5_P183_S000",
    "original_block": "《卷五》\n傷門剋應\n傷門不可說，夫妻主災迍，瘡病行不得，折損血財牲，天穴人枉死，經年有病人，商音信難得，餘事不堪陳。\n問曰：傷門屬木，正值春分之時，嫩甲發生，當以吉看，反以凶論，請問其詳？\n衢仙答曰：「傷門之木，正值春分之氣，精液自內而發揚於外，以致根本洩之太過，所謂以外華而內虛，而不能勝其勞。況二月中嫩甲不能當霜露之寒，因謂之傷，所 以凶也。傷門得奇，惟宜捕捉逃亡盜賊、漁獵、索債、賭戲等事則吉。若上官、出行、嫁娶、商賈、修造、埋葬皆不利，大凶」。\n靜應\n傷門加傷：主變動，遠行皆折傷，凶。\n加杜：主變動、失脫、官司、桎梏，百事凶。\n加景：主文書、印信、口舌、動撓、啾喞。\n加死：主官司、印信，凶。出行，大忌。占病，凶。\n加驚：主親人疾病憂懼，謀伐不利，凶。\n加開：主貴人，開張有走失變動之事，不利。\n加休：主陽人變動，或托人謀幹財名不利。\n加生：原文缺\n加甲戊：主失脫難獲。\n加乙：主求謀不得，反防盜失財。\n加丙：主道路損失。\n加丁：主音信不的。\n加己：主財散人病。\n加庚：主訟獄被刑杖，凶。\n加辛：主夫妻懷私、恣怨。\n加壬：主因盜牽連。\n加癸：主訟獄被冤，有理難伸。\n動應\n傷門出者，三十里見人爭鬪，見漁人或畜爭鬪，敵宜避之，大吉。\n傷門加傷：三里、十三里逢二車塞道爭行。\n加杜：四里、十四里逢公吏人及木匠伐樹，並有婦人抱小兒過。\n加景：九里、十九里逢色衣人騎騾馬過。\n加死：二里、十二里逢埋葬及孝服人哭泣。\n加驚：七里、十七里逢人鬪打並趕畜，有婦人與少女同行。\n加開：六里、十六里逢人拆牆、安門、解板，或二豬相咬。\n加休：一里、十一里逢老婦與少男同行。\n加生：八里、十八里逢人伐樹或培土。\n占身命：水火木命者吉，金命者主病，土命者凶，官司、刑杖。\n杜門剋應\n杜門原是木，犯者災禍頻，亥卯未年月，遭入獄迍生，生死離別事，六畜也多瘟，跌打見膿血，禍害及子孫。\n問曰：杜門陽木，夏冬繁盛之時，本為旺氣，何以凶論？\n衢仙答曰：杜門陽木，時值夏冬，發生於外，而津液已洩，陽氣亢極，一陰將至，木性至此而力屈，欲收斂而不能收斂，欲生旺而力已盡，又不洩其力以實其子，而待陰伏藏其子於堅密之處，恐有傷於子，故謂之杜門，小凶。\n杜門為藏形之方，為宜躲災避難，塞穴、捕捉則吉，餘事皆不利。\n靜應\n杜門加杜：主因父母疾病、田宅出脫事，凶。\n加景：主文書印信阻隔，陽人、小口疾病，遲疑不利。\n加死：主田宅；文書失落，官司破財，小凶。\n加驚：主門戶內憂疑驚恐，並有詞訟事。\n加開：主見貴人、官長，謀事主先破己財後吉。\n加休：主求財有益。\n加生：主陽人小口破財，及田宅求財不成。\n加傷：主兄弟相爭，田產破財。\n加甲戊：主謀事不成，密處求財得。\n加乙：主宜暗求陽人財物，後主不明至訟。\n加丙：主文契遺失。\n加丁：主陽人訟獄。\n加己：主私謀害人招非。\n加庚：主因女人訟獄被刑。\n加辛：主打傷人詞訟，陽人、小口凶。\n加壬：主奸盜事，凶。\n加癸：主百事皆阻，病者不食。\n動應\n杜門出三十里逢少女同行歌唱，六十里逢惡人。乙奇臨，見少婦著色衣；丙奇臨，見火光燒屋或烽火之物；丁奇臨，見人騎馬帶弓弩。\n杜門加杜：四里、十四里逢婦人引孫兒著綠衣。\n加景：九里、十九里逢孕婦著色衣，或公吏人騎赤馬。\n加死：二里、十二里逢喪服人哭泣。\n加驚：七里、十七里逢歌唱鑼鼓聲，或人言公訟事。\n加開：六里、十六里逢歌唱及犬咬豬。\n加休：一里、十一里逢唱戲或皂衣婦人抱孩兒。\n加生：八里、十八里逢人扛錢，或手拿食物並唱詞。\n加傷：三里、十三里逢木匠拿木棍。\n占身命：火命者發貴，水命者發富，木命者平穩，金命者疾病，土命者官司凶。若金年月日時，或土命年月日時者不利，如逢水火年月日時吉。\n景門剋應\n景門主血光，官符賣田莊，禍災應多有，子孫受苦殃，外凶並惡死，六畜也見傷，生離與死別，占者須堤防。\n問曰：景門屬火，南方夏令，正值陽明之域，何以為凶也？\n衢仙答曰：景門夏令之氣，萬物壯盛，將老之時，與死門坤宮相近，又為陽之盛氣，天數至此時，將有殺物之情，雖主上明下亮之方，亦不全吉。惟利文書之事，因為次吉。\n景門用事，惟宜上書、獻策、奏對、選拔將士，吉，餘者不利。坤、艮、中宮吉，三、四宮平之，一宮迫吟，六、七宮迫宮，大凶。若得三奇，又宜於設計行詐、破陣、火攻、號令、封功、賞爵等事。\n靜應\n景門加景：主文狀未動，有預先見之意，內有陽人小口憂患。\n加死：主官訟，因田宅事爭，多啾唧。\n加驚：主陽人、小口疾病事，凶。\n加開：主官人升遷吉，求文印更吉。\n加休：主文書遺失，爭訟不休。\n加生：主陰人生產大喜，更主求財旺利，行人皆吉。\n加傷：主姻親眷小口角，或嫌隙撓亂。\n加杜：主失脫文書，散財後平。\n加甲戊：主因財產詞訟，遠行吉。\n加乙：主訟事不成。\n加丙：主文書急迫，火速不利。\n加丁：主因文書、印狀招非。\n加己：主官事牽連。\n加庚：主訟人自訟。\n加辛：主陰人詞訟。\n加壬：主因賊牽連。\n加癸：主因奴婢致禍。\n動應\n景門出三十里外，赤紋大蛇，七十里外，因水火失物。若強有作為，主東家長及小口。\n景門加景：九里、十九里逢人抱文書，更有火光驚恐。\n加死：二里、十二里逢喪服人哭泣，色衣人騎馬。\n加驚：七里、十七里逢爭訟鬥打，宜避之。\n加開：六里、十六里逢人成隊行，官人騎馬。\n加休：一里、十一里逢女人哭泣與賣魚人並行。\n加生：八里、十八里逢小兒趕牛，人背錢以袋裝之。\n加傷：三里、十三里逢色衣女人坐車轎或乘騾馬。\n加杜：四里、十四里逢老少婦領黑衣童子行。\n占身命：主火災。水命者大凶，金命者疾病，木命者中平，土命者富。若值金水年月日時者，不利。\n死門剋應\n元死之方最為凶，人命逢之禍不輕，犯者平平財產退，更防孝服死人丁。\n問曰：死門屬土，又系黑星，分夜之方，秋冬之氣，天地肅殺，自此而始彰，門凶星凶，當棄之而不用，不知此門寧可用之？\n衢仙答曰：死門之凶，天地令行，大肆肅殺之威，草柳色變，木逢葉落，故為凶象。若得奇相助，而吊死刑、捕捉、畋獵之事，有得吉者，順天之序而然也，不可棄。\n靜應\n死門加死：主官司而留，印信無氣，凶。加死：主官司動而被刑杖，凶？\n加驚：主因官司不給，憂疑、患病，凶。\n加開：主見貴人，求印信、文書事，大利。\n加休：主求財物事不吉，若問僧道求方吉。\n加生：主喪事，求財得。占病，死者複生。\n加傷：原文缺\n加杜：原文缺\n加景：主主因文契、印信、財產事見官，先怒後喜，不凶。\n加甲戊：主作偽財。\n加乙：主求事不成。\n加丙：主信息憂疑。\n加丁：主老陽人疾病。\n加己：主病訟牽連不已，凶。\n加庚：主女人生產，子母俱凶。\n加辛：主盜賊，失脫難獲。\n加壬：主訟人自訟、自招。\n加癸：主嫁娶；婦女事凶。\n動應\n死門出者，二十里逢病人，三十里逢孝服、血光事，雖有三奇，亦不吉。丙奇臨，逢抱文書；乙奇臨，見喪葬祭物或紙扎物；丁奇臨，逢少婦孝服、哭泣。\n死門加死：二里、十二里逢婦人哭泣，凶。\n加驚：七里、十七里逢喪哭泣，或死畜物類。\n加開：六里、十六里逢開墳、哭泣，或畜鬪傷。\n加休：一里、十一里逢青衣婦人哭泣。\n加生：八里、十八里逢孝子拿生物大慟。\n加傷：三里、十三里逢人抬棺槨。\n加杜：四里、十四里逢埋葬及紙扎彩色物。\n加景：九里、十九里逢重孝人哭泣，退吉進凶。\n占身命：主有孝服、病死之凶。水木命並年月日時者，大凶。餘平。\n驚門剋應\n驚門主爭訟，瘟疫死人丁，辰年並花月，非禍進門庭。惟宜詞訟事、捕捉、博戲吉，餘皆凶。\n問曰：驚門屬金，值八月秋令，萬物俱老，天地大示肅殺之威，亦可棄乎？\n衢仙答曰：驚門氣肅，物數蒼老，本無生氣，固凶。但天地存好生之心，不欲殺盡，而生蒜麥，亦不得已而殺也。此門雖凶，若諛詞、獻詐、捕捉、設疑、伏兵皆吉，亦不可棄。\n靜應\n驚門加驚：主疾病、憂慮、驚疑。\n加開：主憂疑、官司、驚恐，又主上見喜，不凶。\n加休：主求財事， 或因口舌、求財事，遲吉。\n加生：主因婦人生憂驚，或因求財生憂驚，皆吉。\n加傷：主因商議同謀害人事洩，惹訟，凶。\n加杜：主因失脫破財、驚恐，不凶。\n加景：主詞訟不息及小口疾病。\n加死：主因宅中怪異而生是非，凶。\n加甲戊：主損財、信阻。\n加乙：主謀財不得。\n加丙：主文書印信驚恐。\n加丁：主詞訟牽連。\n加戊：主因田宅致訟。\n加己：主惡犬傷人成訟。\n加庚：主道路損折、賊盜，凶。\n加辛：主女人成訟，凶。\n加壬：主官司囚禁。病者，大凶。\n加癸：主被盜賊，失物不獲。\n動應\n驚門出者，三十里逢群鳥雀噪，六畜相鬪，四十里見人爭打則吉，若無，七十里必有折損之凶，不可前往。\n驚門加驚：七里、十七里逢二女吵鬧，旁人說打官司。\n加開：六里、十六里逢官吏、役人爭訟。\n加休：一里、十一里逢青衣婦人說官司。\n加生：八里、十八里逢女人引童子趕牛，小兒拿吃物。\n加傷：三里、十三里逢男女吵鬧、打孩子，宜退回。\n若強行，主車折馬死，凶。\n加杜：四里、十四里逢僧道同行，或男女相商。\n加景：九里、十九里逢色衣婦人說官司。\n加死：二里、十二里逢女人哭泣及喪亡者。\n占身命：主詞訟、官災、口舌、血光之事。若值丙丁巳午年月日時，占者，凶；甲乙寅卯年月日時占者，亦不利。\n五假法\n天假：景門合乙丙丁三奇，下臨地盤九天宮者，名曰「天假」。乙為天德，丙為天威，丁為太陰，凡三奇之靈，宜陳事、利便、進謁、乾求之事，大吉。\n地假：杜門合丁己癸，下臨地盤九地宮者，名曰「地假」；宜潛藏、埋伏，此三時宜遁跡藏形。\n地假：傷門合丁己癸，下臨地盤太陰宮者，亦名「地假」；宜遣人、行間諜、謀探私事。又如六合宮，亦名「地假」，宜逃亡、躲災、避難。\n神假：傷門合丁己癸，下臨地盤九地宮者，名曰「神假」，利埋葬。伏藏，人不能知也。\n人假：驚門合六合一作六壬，下臨地盤九天宮者，名曰「人假」，利捕捉逃亡。若太白入熒惑在其下，必獲。\n鬼假：死門合丁己癸，下臨地盤九地宮者，名曰「鬼假」，利超亡、薦度。一作臨「三隱宮」，疑即地盤之三吉門也？三隱宮太陰、六合、九地。\n三詐法\n凡事宜開、休、生三吉門，即不得乙丙丁三奇亦吉。又取陰神相助，謂之三詐，有地盤九地、太陰、六合三神助奇，謂之「陽門得助」，再得地盤吉門相助者，全吉。\n若開、休、生三吉門合乙丙丁三奇，無地盤太陰、六合、九地者，謂之有門無遁，陽有奇無陰，凡事有七分之利。\n開休生三吉門合三奇，下臨地盤太陰之宮者，再得吉門，此吉門當作吉星相助，謂之「真詐」，利施恩、隱遁、祈禱、求仙，吉。\n開休生合三奇，下臨地盤六合宮者，再得吉門相助，謂之「休詐」，宜合藥、法符、祈神、禳災、祭祀，皆大吉。\n開休生合三奇，下臨地盤九地宮者，再得吉門相助，謂之「重詐」，宜收降、添兵、進人口、納財、襲爵、拜綬，皆吉。\n以上詐門，凡事遠行、商賈、嫁娶，百事大吉。\n\n"
  }
}